  {
   "id": "pentiment-204623@1.1",
   "gameId": "pentiment-204623",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-12T20:07:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are happy to let you all know that patch 1.1 for Pentiment is now available to download. This patch includes the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Endris has a new minigame that can be found at the beginning of Act 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Logic issue with the Final Day of Law and Judgment has been fixed to prevent people from being condemned if they were never accused",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Telling Father Gernot your evidence against a character in Act II will no longer automatically prevent you from speaking with that character in the future. There is now a Persuade check in place that can allow the conversation to continue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Credits have been adjusted and updated to contain various additions and fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Parallax has been added to the meadow",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Credits speed can now be adjusted, speeding up, slowing down, pausing, or reversing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• You can now skip the intro",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Created hybrid input option that keeps mouse active when using keyboard and mouse",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added an instant dialogue display option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed bugs with the input mapper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Various Bug Fixes and Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
